WEBVTT

00:03:28.547 --> 00:03:30.664
that just go around
and call you "the loser."

00:03:30.688 --> 00:03:32.593
Well, I'm taking that to heart.

00:03:32.617 --> 00:03:34.825
But now we do something
different in our house,

00:03:34.849 --> 00:03:36.750
so we have these jam sessions,

00:03:36.774 --> 00:03:41.008
and our jam sessions consist
of us jamming in church.

00:03:41.032 --> 00:03:43.465
You know, in church,
we'll look at each other like,

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:44.640
(Beatboxing)

00:03:44.664 --> 00:03:45.665
(Laughter)

00:03:45.689 --> 00:03:47.527
and we'll text the beat to each other.

00:03:48.018 --> 00:03:50.387
Or we'll be in the kitchen cooking,

00:03:50.411 --> 00:03:52.214
road trips, airports.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:55.964
NP: Standing right there in the corner,
"Aw, Dad -- listen to that."

00:03:55.988 --> 00:03:57.176
(Beatboxing)

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.185
Naw, I'm kidding. But you know what?

00:03:59.852 --> 00:04:03.055
We're talking all about this
jam session and everything.